; The test library's fill defines its mode with the form, with lighter
; and keymap clauses; its own variable named keymap is the keymap. The
; mode is an option, off, with the documentation and boolean values; its
; depth, lighter, keymap and name are recorded.
> (list (options:option? fill:mode) (fill:mode) (options:documentation fill:mode) (options:default fill:mode))
(#t #f "Whether typing past fill:column breaks the line." #f)
